  "title": {
   "en": "The Dark Duke's Pet Bird"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "흑막 공작의 애완새"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The poignant bluebird of the marriage market, Isabella Eloise, was betrayed by her blindly devoted fiancé of ten years, and lost her place in the social world. The one who found her on a rainy path was none other than the rumored ghost duke.\n\n“Until your feathers grow anew, I shall care for you,” declared the duke.\n\nShe thought she had been rescued. But it was only until she discovered his secret…\n\n“Beloved Isabella, I’m curious to hear what sounds you’ll make when I push you to your limits,” the duke mused.\n\nBy the time she realized something was terribly wrong, it was already too late to turn back.\n\n“Aedan Holden, you’re insane.”\n\n“Yes, I am. But did you only just figure that out now?”"
  },
